# n8n-loop harness spec deliverables — durable, tracked so a cold resume sees them.
# (ignore specs/ contents, but force-track harness specs; dir-level ignore would
# block re-inclusion, so this uses specs/* + negation.)
!.claude/specs/claude-n8n-chat-bridge.md
.cursor/plans/
.superset
.conductor
.n8n
lefthook-local.yml
.playwright-mcp
stryker.log

# n8n runtime harness scratch (run artifacts/logs)
# Nested per-skill workspaces (e.g. run-n8n boot logs) — fully ignored.
# (.claude/skills is a symlink to plugins/n8n/skills, so ignore the real plugin path.)
.claude/plugins/*/skills/*/_workspace/
# Root autonomous-loop workspace: ignore all run artifacts/logs, but TRACK the
# durable loop ledger + sentinels so a fresh session can cold-resume from committed state.
/_workspace/*
!/_workspace/backlog.md
!/_workspace/loop_state.md
!/_workspace/HANDOFF.md
!/_workspace/DONE
!/_workspace/NEEDS-HUMAN
# Epic A deliverables (the codebase map) — durable product, tracked so downstream
# items (A-2 appends, A-3/A-4 reference) survive a cold resume.
!/_workspace/meta-inventory.md
!/_workspace/meta-codemap.md
!/_workspace/meta-dataflow.md
# Epic B/C deliverables — validated workflow JSON (B-2) survives cold resume.
# (dir-level ignore blocks re-inclusion, so un-ignore the dir then its contents.)
!/_workspace/wf/
!/_workspace/wf/*.json
# Epic C visualization deliverables — mapping (C-1) + validated viz workflows (C-2).
!/_workspace/viz/
!/_workspace/viz/MAPPING.md
!/_workspace/viz/*.json
packages/@n8n/task-runner-python/task_runner_python.egg-info/

# Claude Code scheduler runtime state (transient)
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
